  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />& \\text { (c) Since } x \\frac{d y}{d x}-y=x^4-3 x \\\\<br />& \\therefore \\frac{d y}{d x}-\\frac{y}{x}=x^3-3<br />\\end{aligned}$<br />Hence $I F=e^{\\int P d x}=e^{-\\int \\frac{1}{x} d x}=e^{-\\log x}=\\frac{1}{x}$",
    "image": null
  },
